WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.108
Open Lampstand and choose Try the Welcome service.

2
00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:07.905
Press Space to go live.

3
00:00:08.005 --> 00:00:10.499
Press Space again to move on.

4
00:00:10.599 --> 00:00:15.425
Left arrow goes back, and the full stop blanks the screen.

5
00:00:15.525 --> 00:00:17.872
You do not need a projector to try it.
